OL,3,GNEWSAGB cyclist wins award for final
OL,4,Astage performance
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Worcestershire-born cyclist has
OL,7,Fclaimed the combativity award on the
OL,8,Ffifth and final stage of the Lloyds
OL,9,FTour of Britain Women.
OL,11,FWorcester's Alice Towers was given the
OL,12,Ftitle after organisers acknowledged her
OL,13,Fas the most aggressive and attacking
OL,14,Frider on the day.
OL,16,FThe thousands of spectators in
OL,17,FLeamington Spa, Warwickshire, watched
OL,18,Fon as she joined an early breakaway
OL,19,Fgroup alongside two other riders,
OL,20,Fbuilding a gap of more than two
OL,21,Fminutes.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
