OL,3,GNEWSAGB cyclist wins award for final
OL,4,Astage performance
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the Great Britain National Team
OL,7,Fracer was caught within the final
OL,8,Fkilometre of the race, with Dutch
OL,9,Fsprinter Lorena Wiebes taking the stage
OL,10,Fwin in Leamington Spa.
